# Shop Project Guidance

- Read and follow `.github/copilot-instructions.md` for project-wide requirements.
- Read matching files under `.github/instructions/` before editing scoped paths.
- Treat `pom.xml` and `core/pom.xml` as the source of truth for versions and dependencies.
- Keep changes focused and consistent with the repository's scoped guidance.

## Agentic Workflow

- Delegated subagents must use only models confirmed in the active local custom-provider catalog.
- Never use or fall back to GPT/OpenAI models.
- If no eligible model can be confirmed, continue without delegation.
